===Alternative forms===
* [[plectron]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|plectrum|plēctrum|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} ''[[πλήκτρον]]'' {{qualifier|pléktron}} “anything to strike with,  an instrument for striking the lyre, a spear point”, from ''[[πλήσσειν]]'' {{qualifier|pléssein}} “to strike, to smite, to sting”.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|pl2=plectra}}

# {{context|anatomy|zoology|lang=en}} An [[anatomical]] part resembling a plectrum in shape.
# {{context|music|lang=en}} A small piece of plastic, metal, ivory, etc for [[pluck]]ing the [[string]]s of a [[guitar]], [[lyre]], [[mandolin]], etc.

====Synonyms====
* [[pick]] (US)

